WEBVTT

00:03.511 --> 00:07.432
ORIGINAL WORK: REKI KAWAHARA

00:09.016 --> 00:10.101
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:13.062 --> 00:14.272
<i>Yuma.</i>

00:16.524 --> 00:18.943
<i>Wake up, Yuma.</i>

00:23.281 --> 00:24.490
Where am I?

00:29.871 --> 00:32.915
Oh, right. I'm inside the Caliculus.

00:33.541 --> 00:35.334
Why's it so dark?

00:36.169 --> 00:37.462
Is the power out?

00:39.046 --> 00:40.715
What was that?

00:41.799 --> 00:44.385
There it is.

00:53.060 --> 00:54.979
TESTING
FULLDIVE GAMING CAPSULE - CALICULUS

01:01.611 --> 01:03.488
What the hell happened?

01:06.157 --> 01:07.492
Sawa...

01:16.584 --> 01:18.544
What's that smell?

01:27.053 --> 01:28.012
Sawa?

03:12.325 --> 03:13.909
DEVILS' CREST

03:13.910 --> 03:17.663
EPISODE 1: ENCROACHMENT

03:22.919 --> 03:24.670
Yu, it's headed your way!

03:28.758 --> 03:31.177
YUMA
HORNED GREAT HARE - EAST CALCINA PLAINS

03:33.262 --> 03:34.513
Tenebri--

03:35.556 --> 03:36.682
Damn!

03:39.226 --> 03:40.561
You got this, Yu!

03:41.103 --> 03:42.688
Almost there!

03:44.357 --> 03:45.441
Tenebris!

03:48.444 --> 03:50.613
Capere Anima!

03:54.367 --> 03:55.201
Ignis.

04:09.924 --> 04:12.092
HORNED GREAT HARE

04:12.093 --> 04:14.845
Yes!

04:15.846 --> 04:17.305
Nice going, Yu.

04:17.306 --> 04:18.849
Thanks, Konken.

04:21.435 --> 04:22.268
YUMA

04:22.269 --> 04:23.687
I know, right?

04:23.688 --> 04:25.982
I steer the mob right where we need it.

04:26.565 --> 04:27.941
It takes some serious skill!

04:27.942 --> 04:28.858
KONKEN

04:28.859 --> 04:29.776
SAWA

04:29.777 --> 04:31.611
Why are you acting so smug?

04:31.612 --> 04:32.529
NAGI

04:32.530 --> 04:35.116
It only works like half the time, right?

04:35.700 --> 04:37.158
Hey, Yu.

04:37.159 --> 04:40.496
Try summoning it
with your Monster Tamer skill.

04:41.122 --> 04:42.080
Right now?

04:42.081 --> 04:45.792
Well, the playtest ends in 50 minutes.

04:45.793 --> 04:48.004
Wait, seriously?

04:48.587 --> 04:50.213
This is bad.

04:50.214 --> 04:54.759
I bet Sugamo's group that
we could beat the boss before them.

04:54.760 --> 04:57.554
There you go again.

04:57.555 --> 04:59.140
What did you bet?

05:00.558 --> 05:02.767
Tomorrow's school-lunch chocolate pudding.

05:02.768 --> 05:05.145
Don't say I didn't warn you.

05:05.146 --> 05:07.272
And I'm not giving you any of mine.

05:07.273 --> 05:09.525
I bet... four servings...

05:11.360 --> 05:13.778
What? What?

05:13.779 --> 05:17.532
Hold on, Kenji Kondo.
Who said you could decide that?

05:17.533 --> 05:20.368
I'm sorry! I really am!

05:20.369 --> 05:23.789
I'm sorry, okay?
Just stop using my real name in-game!

05:25.541 --> 05:27.042
Hey, Konken.

05:27.043 --> 05:29.085
That means if we win the bet,

05:29.086 --> 05:31.546
we get four puddings, right?

05:31.547 --> 05:33.799
Of course.

05:36.635 --> 05:38.054
Sounds good to me.

05:42.475 --> 05:45.810
The boss dungeon's pretty far away.

05:45.811 --> 05:47.896
Only 50 minutes left.

05:47.897 --> 05:51.274
We'll need time
to get through the dungeon, too.

05:51.275 --> 05:53.319
It might be pretty tight.

05:54.904 --> 05:57.781
Don't look at me like that! I'm sorry!

05:57.782 --> 05:58.741
No.

05:59.283 --> 06:02.578
We can still make it, just barely.

06:17.343 --> 06:18.343
How much time is left?

06:18.344 --> 06:20.137
Thirty minutes.

06:20.679 --> 06:24.600
I know I made you hurry, but...

06:25.309 --> 06:27.352
Can we still win the bet
with Sugamo's group

06:27.353 --> 06:30.396
if someone else
has already beaten the boss?

06:30.397 --> 06:32.065
Don't worry.

06:32.066 --> 06:33.316
In the guidebook,

06:33.317 --> 06:35.860
it says that this boss room

06:35.861 --> 06:37.112
is an "instance."

06:37.113 --> 06:40.991
Instant? So it only lasts
like three minutes or something?

06:42.451 --> 06:45.495
You need to go back to elementary school.

06:45.496 --> 06:48.039
We're both still in elementary school!

06:48.040 --> 06:50.083
Here's what an instance is.

06:50.084 --> 06:53.211
It's a private map
that can only be cleared

06:53.212 --> 06:54.504
by you or your party.

06:54.505 --> 06:58.675
In this case, the moment we pass through
the entrance to the boss room,

06:58.676 --> 07:01.761
the game should teleport us
to a dedicated map.

07:01.762 --> 07:05.431
So I guess that means there's a boss

07:05.432 --> 07:07.016
for every party that goes in.

07:07.017 --> 07:08.268
Exactly.

07:08.269 --> 07:10.520
So, what are we gonna do?

07:10.521 --> 07:13.106
Stop wasting time and tell us already.

07:13.107 --> 07:15.276
You do have a plan
to make this work, right?

07:17.736 --> 07:19.780
You're gonna summon that thing?

07:21.157 --> 07:22.158
Aperta!

07:32.001 --> 07:34.503
- It's a bit small.
- Yeah.

07:36.130 --> 07:37.547
Cu...

07:37.548 --> 07:40.300
Cute!

07:40.301 --> 07:43.179
Hey, it's not a pet.

07:43.888 --> 07:45.930
REGISTER A NAME TO ACTIVATE SKILLS

07:45.931 --> 07:47.807
A name?

07:47.808 --> 07:50.435
I'm terrible at naming things.

07:50.436 --> 07:52.396
Yu, we're running out of time.

07:57.359 --> 07:59.819
All right. You're Squeak.

07:59.820 --> 08:02.113
What? Squeak?

08:02.114 --> 08:04.199
That kind of sounds like a dog's name.

08:04.200 --> 08:07.828
Squeak, command:
Lead us to the end of the dungeon.

08:10.915 --> 08:12.208
Hey, Yu!

08:21.508 --> 08:23.218
What's it doing now?

08:23.219 --> 08:26.471
It's Squeak's Tunnel Search skill.

08:26.472 --> 08:28.014
It can search for items

08:28.015 --> 08:30.684
or guide you through a dungeon.

08:31.310 --> 08:33.102
In early dungeons like this,

08:33.103 --> 08:34.312
beating the boss

08:34.313 --> 08:37.732
usually opens the exit
right where you are.

08:37.733 --> 08:40.235
So if we tell it to take us to the end,

08:40.236 --> 08:43.613
it'll lead us to the boss room, right?

08:43.614 --> 08:47.867
So that's why you wanted to capture it?

08:47.868 --> 08:50.620
Games are the one and only
thing Yu's good at.

08:50.621 --> 08:52.498
You could've left out "one and only."

08:59.713 --> 09:02.382
Konken, are you scared?

09:02.383 --> 09:04.592
I'm not scared.

09:04.593 --> 09:08.054
I'm the Dungeon Master
of Yukihana Elementary!

09:08.055 --> 09:09.138
I'm going in!

09:09.139 --> 09:11.267
You're supposed to stay behind us!

09:16.230 --> 09:18.148
Wait! Hey!

09:40.754 --> 09:41.922
Squeak, stop.

09:46.260 --> 09:48.262
So cute!

09:49.013 --> 09:50.347
Yeah, yeah.

09:51.307 --> 09:52.433
Thanks.

09:53.767 --> 09:55.060
I'll call on you again.

09:57.771 --> 09:59.440
Clause.

10:05.529 --> 10:07.823
HORNED GREAT HARE

10:26.508 --> 10:29.470
Hey! Wait up, Kondo!

10:34.391 --> 10:35.851
Sugamo...

10:44.777 --> 10:46.527
ANCIENT CASTLE:
GREAT UNDERGROUND PASSAGE

10:46.528 --> 10:48.279
Kondo. The boss room...

10:48.280 --> 10:49.197
LUCIUS

10:49.198 --> 10:50.114
RIA

10:50.115 --> 10:52.033
We're going in first!

10:52.034 --> 10:52.950
KAI

10:52.951 --> 10:57.456
Listen, the boss room is an insta... insta?

10:59.291 --> 11:00.876
Instance!

11:01.460 --> 11:02.919
It's an instance!

11:02.920 --> 11:05.463
So, it doesn't matter
who goes in first, Gamo!

11:05.464 --> 11:09.550
We each fight the boss separately
in our own zone!

11:09.551 --> 11:13.346
Hey! I told you to stop
calling me that ages ago!

11:13.347 --> 11:15.932
Yeah! What's with the weird nickname?

11:15.933 --> 11:19.102
We call him Lucius in here! Got it?

11:19.103 --> 11:21.480
Yeah, yeah. I got it, Miso.

11:23.148 --> 11:25.734
I told you to stop calling me that!

11:28.320 --> 11:29.863
You tryin' to piss me off?

11:37.830 --> 11:39.997
You're buying these?

11:39.998 --> 11:41.624
They're the newest ones!

11:41.625 --> 11:43.502
I'm still trying to decide.

11:44.545 --> 11:47.005
There are lots of other ones too.

11:48.757 --> 11:51.134
I think they'd all look good on you.

11:51.135 --> 11:53.387
Which ones do you think are best?

11:54.430 --> 11:55.514
I...

11:56.473 --> 11:59.143
These...

12:00.436 --> 12:04.022
Like you know anything
about sneaker brands.

12:07.860 --> 12:11.904
How many times do I gotta tell you?
Call me Ria in-game!

12:11.905 --> 12:15.784
No, no... I couldn't possibly, Misono-san.

12:20.622 --> 12:21.873
ANCIENT CASTLE:
GREAT UNDERGROUND PASSAGE

12:21.874 --> 12:23.292
Watamaki.

12:25.002 --> 12:26.295
SUMIKA

12:28.213 --> 12:30.048
Why are you in Gamo's party?

12:33.469 --> 12:37.097
Of course Watamaki's in my party.

12:38.140 --> 12:42.978
We're on a whole different level
from a group of casuals like you.

12:43.645 --> 12:46.147
So get out of our way!

12:46.148 --> 12:47.691
And we're off!

12:48.525 --> 12:49.692
Hey, wait!

12:49.693 --> 12:52.112
It's fine. Let them go first.

12:55.782 --> 12:57.951
Good luck on the rest of your run, guys!

13:02.539 --> 13:06.502
Don't forget our
chocolate pudding bet, Kondo!

13:09.046 --> 13:11.381
All that energy, just to be annoying.

13:11.965 --> 13:15.426
Seriously, who just shouts
people's real names like that?

13:15.427 --> 13:17.471
Wait, you did that to me earlier, so...

13:20.307 --> 13:22.808
Let's put that behind us and go!

13:22.809 --> 13:26.729
Yeah. We're gonna beat this boss
and win the bet.

13:26.730 --> 13:27.773
Let's do this!

13:28.941 --> 13:31.693
Why are you trying to act all cool?
That's not like you.

13:37.449 --> 13:39.368
TORCH

13:51.088 --> 13:53.005
A dragon?

13:53.006 --> 13:55.800
Right in the first dungeon?

13:55.801 --> 13:57.260
DRAGON
BOSS ROOM NO. 18

13:57.261 --> 14:01.014
It's not exactly surprising
to see one as a boss, but...

14:07.104 --> 14:08.980
Here comes the breath! Sawa!

14:08.981 --> 14:09.898
Got it!

14:10.566 --> 14:12.484
Aqua! Murum!

14:13.735 --> 14:14.902
Ardougne!

14:14.903 --> 14:16.655
Water Wall!

14:18.240 --> 14:20.283
Nagi, buff Konken.

14:20.284 --> 14:21.660
Konken, attack!

14:24.746 --> 14:25.914
Lumen.

14:26.498 --> 14:27.708
Nubes.

14:29.001 --> 14:30.377
Fusione...

14:31.545 --> 14:33.255
Light Enhance!

14:42.222 --> 14:44.807
I'll stop its breath! Get in there, Yu!

14:44.808 --> 14:46.184
All right.

14:59.406 --> 15:00.824
SAWA

15:10.125 --> 15:11.459
We've totally got this!

15:11.460 --> 15:12.960
DRAGON

15:12.961 --> 15:15.212
Its attacks can't be this simple.

15:15.213 --> 15:19.091
If it doesn't fly, then a dragon's
other main weapons are...

15:19.092 --> 15:20.594
its breath, its claws, and its...

15:22.763 --> 15:23.597
Duck!

15:29.436 --> 15:30.354
Nagi!

15:33.690 --> 15:37.235
Sawa! Konken, take aggro! Nagi, cover me!

15:37.944 --> 15:39.488
That hurt...

15:40.947 --> 15:41.864
Sawa!

15:41.865 --> 15:42.949
I'm okay!

15:52.918 --> 15:55.086
Stay back. We'll handle the rest.

15:55.087 --> 15:57.463
I told you, I'm fine!

15:57.464 --> 15:59.548
I've still got healing items.

15:59.549 --> 16:00.549
No!

16:00.550 --> 16:02.469
Yuumy?

16:05.931 --> 16:08.057
I'm really okay.

16:08.058 --> 16:09.184
Let's go!

16:14.898 --> 16:16.983
Rage Slash!

16:17.526 --> 16:19.402
Way to go, Lucius!

16:19.403 --> 16:22.280
Don't count me out... Tonitrus!

16:23.031 --> 16:24.282
Sagitta!

16:24.950 --> 16:25.992
Ignis!

16:26.535 --> 16:28.078
Lightning Arrow!

16:29.287 --> 16:31.957
RIA
LUCIUS

16:34.251 --> 16:35.918
Thanks, Watamaki!

16:35.919 --> 16:39.964
Come on, Kai!
Make yourself useful for once!

16:39.965 --> 16:41.258
Yeah!

16:44.553 --> 16:45.803
Kakeru. Breath attack.

16:45.804 --> 16:46.847
Okay!

16:56.231 --> 16:57.565
It's tough, all right.

16:57.566 --> 17:01.778
Maybe we should've brought a bigger party.

17:02.863 --> 17:05.197
We can handle this, just the two of us.

17:05.198 --> 17:06.783
It won't even be hard.

17:07.701 --> 17:09.035
Not compared to back then.

17:10.495 --> 17:12.037
True enough.

17:12.038 --> 17:13.497
Let's do this, Haruki!

17:13.498 --> 17:14.791
Yeah!

17:26.386 --> 17:28.138
Almost got it!

17:28.889 --> 17:30.807
Both of you, together!

17:31.308 --> 17:33.977
Aqua. Sagitta.

17:38.064 --> 17:41.234
Ignis. Water Arrow!

17:42.319 --> 17:43.153
DRAGON

17:57.793 --> 17:59.543
Yes!

17:59.544 --> 18:01.463
We did it!

18:10.555 --> 18:12.474
Four minutes and 33 seconds.

18:12.974 --> 18:14.810
There's no way Gamo's group beat that!

18:15.310 --> 18:17.311
I wouldn't be so sure.

18:17.312 --> 18:19.980
Their gear looked
quite a bit better than ours.

18:19.981 --> 18:24.277
VRMMOs aren't about gear.
Skill is all that matters!

18:24.820 --> 18:27.446
That's rich coming from a total beginner.

18:27.447 --> 18:30.241
We've only been playing for three hours.

18:30.242 --> 18:34.411
Now that you mention it,
the playtest should be ending soon.

18:34.412 --> 18:37.123
So do we just wait here, or...?

18:38.416 --> 18:43.296
They didn't say anything
during orientation about logging out.

18:44.965 --> 18:45.965
FRIENDS
SAWA - NAGI - KONKEN

18:45.966 --> 18:49.594
Yeah, there's no logout button
in the menu either.

18:50.095 --> 18:53.264
Maybe they just didn't
want the playtesters

18:53.265 --> 18:55.224
to be able to log out on their own.

18:55.225 --> 18:57.184
I get that, but...

18:57.185 --> 19:00.396
But that means there's no way
for us to leave the game, right?

19:00.397 --> 19:04.150
So, we're stuck inside Actual Magic?

19:04.818 --> 19:08.028
Well, why don't we just wait and see?

19:08.029 --> 19:09.906
It's almost time anyway.

19:13.326 --> 19:14.661
What the hell is this?

19:31.553 --> 19:32.678
Sawa!

19:32.679 --> 19:34.222
Yuumy!

19:55.452 --> 19:56.578
<i>Yuumy!</i>

20:10.091 --> 20:11.967
Sawa, Sawa!

20:11.968 --> 20:14.012
Saps, hey!

20:15.013 --> 20:16.806
Yu, put pressure on the wound!

20:17.307 --> 20:18.183
Yu!

20:24.981 --> 20:25.941
Somebody...

20:33.573 --> 20:36.451
I'll go get a teacher!

20:41.081 --> 20:42.082
Sawa!

20:42.832 --> 20:44.834
Yuumy...

20:45.418 --> 20:49.005
Sawa! I'm sorry. I'm sorry!

20:49.673 --> 20:50.966
I'm sorry.

20:51.591 --> 20:53.051
I'm so sorry!

20:56.179 --> 20:57.472
Where am I?

21:09.234 --> 21:10.360
Sawa...

21:19.452 --> 21:21.454
What's that smell?

21:30.046 --> 21:30.880
Sawa?

21:47.230 --> 21:49.733
Watamaki?

23:27.997 --> 23:28.831
TRANSFORMATION

23:28.832 --> 23:29.832
<i>Don't kill her.</i>

23:29.833 --> 23:30.999
<i>Looking for something?</i>

23:31.000 --> 23:32.126
<i>What are you saying?</i>

23:32.127 --> 23:35.170
<i>Until just now, it couldn't be opened
from either side.</i>

23:35.171 --> 23:36.630
<i>It was the same for me.</i>

23:36.631 --> 23:38.173
<i>That can't be possible!</i>

23:38.174 --> 23:39.926
<i>Reality was pitch black.</i>

23:40.802 --> 23:42.928
<i>What're you doing, buttbrain?</i>

23:42.929 --> 23:45.014
Translated by Robert Edison
